flowchart TD
    expand[Expand schema with Alembic\nKeep existing writer canonical]
    backfill[Resumable backfill\nLedger and reviewed mapping]
    compare[Compare relationships and policy decisions]
    review{Equivalent or reviewed restriction?}
    quarantine[Quarantine ambiguity\nCorrect mapping and replay batch]
    shadow[Shadow reads for selected organization\nServe canonical existing decisions]
    fence[Fence organization legacy writes]
    delta[Apply final delta and verify revocations]
    cutover[Switch organization to canonical target]
    observe[Observe tenant pilot and audit]
    rollback[Target compatible application rollback\nKeep target schema and legacy write fence]
    contract[Contract after verified window\nRemove obsolete reads and schema]
    engine[Separate database engine change\nPostgreSQL 15 baseline to PostgreSQL 18\nIndependent backup and restore rehearsal]

    expand --> backfill --> compare --> review
    review -->|No| quarantine --> backfill
    review -->|Yes| shadow --> fence --> delta --> cutover --> observe
    observe -->|Compatible application issue| rollback --> observe
    observe -->|All checks accepted| contract
    expand -.->|Independent change schedule| engine
    engine -.->|Independent recovery evidence| contract
